    "actClause": "AN ACT to amend the domestic relations law and the Indian law, in relation to solemnization of marriage by certain officials on an Indian reservation",
    "basePrintNo": "S7182",
    "basePrintNoStr": "S7182-2013",
    "coSponsors": {
